  triage:title "PR #1483 body falsely claimed every evidence JSON carries source_revision 5f2b1bb3d" ;
  triage:description "req-qa, independently confirmed by quality-mgr, BB-EVIDENCE-QA-1789287034 (PR #1483, report 2026-09-13T11:10:00Z). PR #1483's body claimed 'Every evidence JSON carries source_revision 5f2b1bb3d' -- confirmed false for 2 of 9 evidence files: the second graft-hermes FAIL run and the final PASS run both record source_revision = 4cb8be1cee7b7f0d5b42a76aa83344128f861164, one triage-only commit above the pin (git diff --stat 5f2b1bb3d 4cb8be1ce touches only .triage/phase-bb/findings/BB-READY-004.ttl, zero code diff), because the integrate worktree had fast-forwarded to team-lead's triage push between smoke runs. This is the same benign worktree-drift pattern already documented this phase, not evidence fabrication -- the PASS result remains valid proof of the code's actual behavior -- but the PR body's claim was factually wrong." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-bb" ;
  triage:triageMode "evidence_verification" ;
  triage:category "process" ;
  triage:severity "important" ;
  triage:source "req-qa, verified by quality-mgr, BB-EVIDENCE-QA-1789287034" ;
