  triage:status "fixed" ;
  triage:dispatchReady false ;
  triage:triagedAt "2026-09-13T08:35:46Z"^^xsd:dateTime ;
  triage:deferredNote "Lead ruling (2026-09-13, team-lead): important, closed-on-write per fenix -- fenix corrected PR #1483's body immediately with a disclosure of the benign drift (no re-run needed, since the code exercised is byte-identical), independently confirmed via gh pr view 1483 --json body. No fix branch/dev dispatch needed. RE-VERIFIED (2026-09-13T08:56:12Z): quality-mgr BB-EVIDENCE-QA2-1789290100 (PR #1483 @ 4c57a786d, report 01M2CZKQ79599VG80XP44J0TD5) confirms the corrected body byte-for-byte accurate -- req-qa read all 7 evidence JSONs (source_revision grouping matches), quality-mgr independently re-ran git diff --stat 5f2b1bb3d 4cb8be1ce confirming BB-READY-004.ttl only, zero code diff." ;
